cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Low-energy scattering numerical laboratory"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Numerical laboratory for cold atoms at low energy. Two-body universality from
  the scattering length and the effective range, checked against closed forms
  and published tables; and the harmonic trap that holds the atoms, including
  the design calculation for an accordion optical lattice and the conditions
  for a two-dimensional gas.
keywords:
  - cold atoms
  - low-energy scattering
  - scattering length
  - effective range
  - Bose-Einstein condensate
  - harmonic trap
  - optical lattice
  - two-dimensional gas
license: MIT
